; Example: Countdown loop in SUBLEQ
; x = 3
; while x > 0:
;     x = x - 1

; Memory Layout
; [0] = 0 (Zero constant)
; [1] = 1 (Constant 1)
; [2] = 3 (Variable X)

; Compiled stream (addresses are instruction starts):
; Addr | A  B  C  | Meaning
;  3   | 2  0  9  | [CHECK] If X <= 0 jump to exit (9)
;  6   | 1  2  3  | [BODY]  X = X - 1
;  9   | 2  2  3  | [JUMP]  Unconditional jump back to check (3)
; 12   | -1 -1 -1 | [HALT]

; Full memory image starting at 0:
0 1 3  2 0 9  1 2 3  2 2 3  -1 -1 -1
